<Project>

    <!-- INHERITANCE STOPS HERE, DELIBERATELY. MSBuild walks up until it finds one of these files, so
         this empty one keeps the repository root's properties off the probe: the shipped plugin's
         version, its analyzer set, its warnings-as-errors and its lock-file policy all belong to the
         artefact somebody installs. The probe is an instrument. It is built only by the job that runs
         the measurement, it ships to nobody, and inheriting a version number from the plugin would
         make a second thing claim to be that version. -->

</Project>
